    "result": "I rewrote `Split` in `fields.go`, but I have not run the tests. Both `go test` calls were blocked because they need your approval.\n\n- **Signature:** `Split(line string) ([]string, error)`.\n- **Quoted fields:** a field in double quotes can hold commas, and `\"\"` inside it becomes one `\"`. Spaces inside the quotes are kept.\n- **Spaces:** spaces around a field outside quotes are trimmed. An empty line returns one empty field.\n- **Errors:** an unterminated quote returns `ErrQuote`. So does any text after a closing quote other than spaces before the next comma.\n- **Quotes inside a plain field:** a quote in the middle of an unquoted field, like `a\"b`, stays as literal text and is not an error. Your spec did not cover this case, so I picked this behavior.\n\nI changed `fields_test.go` into table tests. The two old cases are still in it, now checking the error return. I added tests for each quoting rule and for each `ErrQuote` case.\n\nTo check it, run `go test ./...` in the repo, or approve the command and I will run it.",
